{"unit_id":"damozhang__dsh-herdr-bridge#card-zh","repo":"damozhang/dsh-herdr-bridge","commit":"d0159788ed751813ba68bd71772d1ee973350f0e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"herdr-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 的 DSH 插件：它把 DSH 会话连接到本机 Herdr，让 agent 能在网页会话中发现并操作其他代理。插件向 DSH 注册六个工具，涵盖列出运行中的代理、创建工作区并启动代理、向代理发送任务并读取输出、一步委派任务、在 pane 中运行命令，以及关闭工作区。适合通过 Herdr 管理多个编码代理并希望从 DSH Web 协调它们的用户。需要本机安装 Herdr 并提供 herdr CLI；插件调用时会使用 HERDR_SOCKET_PATH，未设置时采用默认 socket 路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:57-326","src/index.ts:16-29"]}
{"unit_id":"damozhang__dsh-herdr-bridge#card-en","repo":"damozhang/dsh-herdr-bridge","commit":"d0159788ed751813ba68bd71772d1ee973350f0e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"herdr-bridge connects DSH Web to local Herdr. Its tools list and start agents, send tasks and read results, run pane commands, close workspaces, or delegate a task end to end. It suits users coordinating coding agents. The Herdr CLI is required; calls use HERDR_SOCKET_PATH or the default socket.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:57-326","src/index.ts:16-29"]}
