{"unit_id":"damozhang__dsh-herdr-bridge#feature-1","repo":"damozhang/dsh-herdr-bridge","commit":"d0159788ed751813ba68bd71772d1ee973350f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"herdr-bridge 的功能「发现 Herdr 代理」：查询当前运行的代理并返回其 pane、状态和工作目录，供后续选择协作目标。通过 herdr_agent_list 工具触发，无需输入参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:58-79"]}
{"unit_id":"damozhang__dsh-herdr-bridge#feature-2","repo":"damozhang/dsh-herdr-bridge","commit":"d0159788ed751813ba68bd71772d1ee973350f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"herdr-bridge 的功能「委派任务给新代理」：在指定目录建立工作区、启动选定类型的代理、提交任务并等待完成，返回代理输出；可选择完成后关闭工作区。通过 herdr_delegate 工具输入任务和目录触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:202-264"]}
{"unit_id":"damozhang__dsh-herdr-bridge#feature-3","repo":"damozhang/dsh-herdr-bridge","commit":"d0159788ed751813ba68bd71772d1ee973350f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"herdr-bridge 提供代理控制：启动新代理、向已有代理发消息并查看输出，还能在 pane 执行命令或关闭工作区。用户按操作调用对应工具，并提供目录、pane、消息或命令等输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82-200","src/index.ts:267-326"]}
{"unit_id":"damozhang__dsh-herdr-bridge#caveat-1","repo":"damozhang/dsh-herdr-bridge","commit":"d0159788ed751813ba68bd71772d1ee973350f0e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用前需本机安装 Herdr 并可调用其 CLI；工具默认连接 ~/.config/herdr/herdr.sock，也可设置 HERDR_SOCKET_PATH 更换路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:16-29"]}
